s for the whole brand.',tags:['Kinetic type', 'Brand-led']},{slug:'one-life-fitness',name:'One Life Fitness',host:'onelifefitnes.vercel.app',url:'https://onelifefitnes.vercel.app/',kicker:'Gym membership site',ac:'#39E0A0',body:'Dark, high-energy layout with class schedules, programme breakdowns, transformation proof and a join flow that lands in WhatsApp within two taps.',tags:['Schedule grid', 'Lead flow']},{slug:'power-fitness-zone',name:'Power Fitness Zone',host:'power-fitness-zone-gym.vercel.app',url:'https://power-fitness-zone-gym.vercel.app/',kicker:'Gym &amp; training facility',ac:'#FFAE1A',body:'Facility-led design that sells the room itself — equipment galleries, trainer profiles, programme cards and a sticky call-and-WhatsApp bar for phone traffic.',tags:['Gallery', 'Sticky CTA']},{slug:'apexiffy',name:'Apexiffy',host:'apexiffy.vercel.app',url:'https://apexiffy.vercel.app/',kicker:'Business front-end',ac:'#4E8CFF',body:'A clean corporate build with a disciplined grid, sectioned service architecture and conversion paths placed where attention actually lands.',tags:['Service grid', 'Conversion paths']},{slug:'alphaedge',name:'AlphaEdge',host:'alphaedge-five.vercel.app',url:'https://alphaedge-five.vercel.app/',kicker:'Premium business presence',ac:'#9FB6D4',body:'Sharp, professional and deliberately quiet — depth carried by material and spacing rather than decoration, so the copy does the selling.',tags:['Premium layout', 'Restrained motion']},{slug:'lotus',name:'Lotus',host:'lotus-one-orpin.vercel.app',url:'https://lotus-one-orpin.vercel.app/',kicker:'Boutique brand site',ac:'#FF8FC0',body:'A softer, more elegant register — generous whitespace, refined type pairing and gentle scroll reveals for a brand that sells on feel.',tags:['Elegant type', 'Soft reveals']}];window.TEAM=[{slug:'hashir',link:'https://hashir.nexlyr.solutions/',linkLabel:'View portfolio',name:'M. Hashir',role:'Founder · Lead Web Developer',tags:['Web Development', 'Brand &amp; Logo Design'