+
+ {t:'ad audits', w:1.5, k:['audit my ads','review my ads','ads not working','ads not converting','wasting money on ads','my ads stopped working','fix my campaigns','why are my ads expensive','high cpc','bad leads'],
+  a:`We audit what is there first: structure, audiences, creative and what the numbers actually say. Then we tell you honestly whether it needs restructuring or just better creative.<br><br>Sometimes the campaign is fine and the landing page is the problem. Since the site and the ads are built by the same studio, we can say which it is instead of blaming the other half.`},
