+ {t:'ad spend and accounts', w:1.4, k:['who pays meta','do you take a cut','percentage of ad spend','commission on ads','do i keep the pixel','minimum ad budget'],
+  a:`You pay Meta and Google directly from your own ad account, so you keep the pixel, the data and the history if you ever change agency.<br><br>We are paid for the work, not a slice of your spend, which means there is no incentive for us to tell you to spend more than you should.`},
